  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-08-04",
   "text": "Assault Weapons Excise Act\n This bill imposes an additional 1000% excise tax on large capacity ammunition feeding devices and semiautomatic assault weapons. It exempts from such additional tax devices and weapons acquired by the United States or by a state or local government."
  }
